  "conclusion": "The Filter 2 target kernel now loads its coefficient from the versioned state slot and performs a real signed 32x32-to-Q1.31 multiply twice per sample. Endpoint/intermediate impulse vectors, an alternating signed-limit vector, and active-zero-active consecutive callback entries through the mixer boundary all match the independent oracle.",
  "scope_limit": "The coefficient is writable state but is not yet connected to a Rytm parameter or cutoff mapping. Only lane 0 is implemented, and hardware cycle margin remains unmeasured.",
